@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+---
+features:
+  - |
+    Add a ``min`` argument to ``wait_exponential_jitter``, matching
+    ``wait_exponential``, to set a floor on the wait time.
+  - |
+    ``wait_exponential_jitter`` now accepts ``datetime.timedelta`` values for
+    ``max``, ``jitter`` and ``min``, as well as numbers of seconds.
